OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency drought grants to open
OL,4,Afor farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farming charity has developed a #2m
OL,7,Fgrant in response to "the exceptional
OL,8,Fdrought and prolonged dry weather
OL,9,Fconditions" that have affected farmers
OL,10,Fthis summer.
OL,12,FThe Royal Agricultural Benevolent
OL,13,FInstitution (RABI), based in Botley,
OL,14,FOxford, will roll out the emergency
OL,15,Fsupport in five phases, starting on 7
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FEligible farm owners and tenant farmers
OL,19,Flocated in an officially designated
OL,20,Fdrought area in England and Wales will
OL,21,Fbe given a maximum of #2,000 towards
OL,22,Fpersonal and household living costs.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
