OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency drought grants to open
OL,4,Afor farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the South, applications for Dorset
OL,7,Fwill be the first to open, while those
OL,8,Fin Oxfordshire, Berkshire, Hampshire
OL,9,Fand the Isle of Wight will be able to
OL,10,Fapply from 21 September.
